Description: TobiXu GNOME identity — system seeds
 Default look and feel for the TobiXu GNU/Linux distribution when the
 user chooses the GNOME session. Seeds the dconf database with
 orbita-noche wallpaper, the modified keyboard options (compose:rctrl +
 lv3:ralt_switch), Adwaita-dark + Papirus, fractional scaling hint for
 Wayland, and the curated favorite apps. Honors Doctrine 13: defaults
 are seeds, not chains — the user harvests freely via gnome-tweaks or
 dconf-editor.

